<title>SINGAPORE: Thai Rangsit Plaza secures transferable loan.</title>
<headline>Thai Rangsit Plaza secures transferable loan.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Rangsit Plaza Company Ltd has obtained a US$48 million transferable loan facility, agent Keppel Bank of Singapore Ltd said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The statement said this was the first time Rangsit Plaza had raised funds outside Thailand.</p>
<p>The three-year facility pays a margin of 105 basis points over the Singapore Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>&quot;We are pleased with the success of this loan facility. Proceeds...will be used to partially refinance the existing loans of Rangsit Plaza...,&quot; Khun Suchin Wanglee, chairman of Rangsit Plaza, said in the statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 870-3080)</p>
</text>
